Subject: venus: fence fds over the xnulinux DRM bridge are private, and their errors are errors

A fence fd is a stand-in that only this driver can wait on (gpu/xnu-drm/darwin), so no external sync fds are offered over
the bridge. A poll() on one that fails is no answer: report it (VK_ERROR_DEVICE_LOST) instead of waiting on.

--- a/src/virtio/vulkan/vn_renderer_sim_syncobj.c
+++ b/src/virtio/vulkan/vn_renderer_sim_syncobj.c
@@ -89,7 +89,8 @@
